rue},{"text":"西连山跳跃如野牛。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华的声音携闪电而来。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华的声音震动旷野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华震动加低斯的旷野。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华的声音击倒橡树","poem":1},{"noteId":2},{"text":"，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使树木凋零。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"众人在祂殿中高呼：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“荣耀！”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华坐在洪涛之上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华永远坐着为王。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华赐力量给自己的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华赐给他们平安的福乐。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":2,"caller":"+","text":"“击倒橡树”或译“使母鹿生产”。","reference":{"chapter":29,"verse":9}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/29.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/30.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/28.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}